{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n想用親民價錢享受豪華住宿？杜如風（Helen）在今晚（17日）播出的《跟風旅行團》中，就為大家開箱位於雪嶽山的森林渡假村！這裡的住宿不但有玻璃屋頂設計，可以躺在床上看風景，價錢更僅需500多到1,000零元港幣，CP值極高，究竟有幾正？\n</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/9064325f-306c-49fa-b754-7a433b78ba4f_18670230236afc5dbc25259-1024x576.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"跟風旅行團 杜如風 2025年新聞的樹屋旅館！（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/9064325f-306c-49fa-b754-7a433b78ba4f_18670230236afc5dbc25259-1024x576.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>2025年新聞的樹屋旅館！（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>玻璃屋頂樹屋露台 杜如風開箱雪嶽山無敵靚景住宿</h2>\n<p>杜如風今次開箱的「雪嶽山森林度假村」，最大特色是大部分住宿的屋頂均採用了玻璃設計，讓住客可以安躺床上或身處室內，就能欣賞到屋外的無敵靚景。其中一款「樹屋」的露台，更是欣賞冬天雪景的天花板級選擇。整個住宿空間夠大、夠新淨，而且充滿設計感，屋外盡是優美的自然美景，絕對是打卡首選。</p>\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://www.foresttrip.go.kr/indvz/main.do?hmpgId=ID02030129\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">수락산 동막골자연휴양림</a>森林度假住宿</strong><br/>\n地址：首爾市蘆原區上溪洞9號</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/screenshot-2026-11-17-at-9.52.17pm_14529571636afc5c2060f6f.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"跟風旅行團 杜如風 航拍介紹影片，超過160 次瀏覽！（圖片來源：BLIMP ）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1062\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/screenshot-2026-11-17-at-9.52.17pm_14529571636afc5c2060f6f.png\" width=\"858\"/></a><figcaption>航拍介紹影片，超過160 次瀏覽！（圖片來源：BLIMP ）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>每晚僅500蚊起跳 杜如風揭超矜貴預訂規則</h2>\n<p>如此充滿設計感的森林系住宿，價錢卻相當親民，僅由500多到1,000零元港幣不等，CP值極高。不過，這間渡假村有一個非常特別的規定，就是每人每次只能預訂一晚，可見其相當矜貴和搶手。杜如風在節目中也對此感到驚訝，更凸顯了這間渡假村的獨特魅力，想體驗就要提早計劃了。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/e04aafdb-f1f6-4cc6-ab80-0f08d1830d19_12549910376afc5de16fad4-1024x576.jpeg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"跟風旅行團 杜如風 極受歡迎！（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/e04aafdb-f1f6-4cc6-ab80-0f08d1830d19_12549910376afc5de16fad4-1024x576.jpeg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>極受歡迎！（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<h2>網民心心眼：呢間CP值太高！</h2>\n<p>渡假村的超高性價比和獨特設計，立即引起網民關注，不少人都表示非常心動。網民留言：「千幾蚊住到玻璃屋？仲要喺雪嶽山？即刻想訂！」、「每人只可以訂一晚咁串？肯定好搶手！」、「冬天去睇雪景一定好浪漫！」、「多謝Helen介紹，又多個住宿選擇！」、「呢啲先係真．嘆世界！」</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_874253996afbe2c4bbd26.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"跟風旅行團 杜如風 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/18_874253996afbe2c4bbd26.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_12848739346afbe2c9b5c8c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"跟風旅行團 杜如風 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/19_12848739346afbe2c9b5c8c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20_16755132746afbe2ce2bd03.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"跟風旅行團 杜如風 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20_16755132746afbe2ce2bd03.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DPi1Wj-kwQS/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">또떠남 ddoddunam（@ddoddunam）分享的貼文</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n<p></p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21_4198184836afbe2d34d99d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"跟風旅行團 杜如風 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/21_4198184836afbe2d34d99d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T14:15:08.395078+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":997,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T13:50:30+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T14:38:28.965276+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T14:08:34.093647+00:00","content_hash":"428d7935b4ff4bfd415c0b5b2c2d76919383700002d1631f41b4966821c729aa","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}